OL,3,GNEWSAModest boost for hotels during All
OL,4,AIreland Fleadh in Belfast
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe All Ireland Fleadh gave the Belfast
OL,7,Fhotel market a modest boost during
OL,8,FAugust, initial survey data suggests.
OL,10,FOfficial figures suggest that an
OL,11,Festimated 189,000 hotel beds were sold
OL,12,Fin the city, up almost 4% compared with
OL,13,F182,000 bed sales in August 2025.
OL,15,FRoom occupancy rates in the city were
OL,16,Fup by two percentage points
OL,17,Fyear-on-year, from 83% to 85%.
OL,19,FThe Fleadh Cheoil na hEireann ran from
OL,20,F2 to 9 August - it was the first time
OL,21,Fthe event had been held in Belfast.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
